documentation in this repository.

Public Drupal.org issue titles, excerpts and comments quoted in
reports/ and tests/fixtures/ are third-party content. They are reproduced for
evidence and regression testing with source links and author attribution. They
remain subject to Drupal.org's terms and their authors' rights, and are not
relicensed under the MIT licence.

WCAG criterion titles are from the W3C WCAG 2.2 Recommendation.

The vendored OpenACR schema and catalog in
`src/acr_evidence/standards/openacr/` are from CivicActions/openacr (fork of
GSA/openacr), pinned to commit d6d18a9. They are CC0/public domain except W3C
data files, which remain under the W3C Software and Document Notice and License.
See the vendored LICENSE.md.

ATAG 2.0 criteria data in `src/acr_evidence/standards/atag/` is derived from the
W3C WAI ATAG Report Tool (https://github.com/w3c/wai-atag-report-tool), pinned to
commit 40926feb7e09c7b486da4d502705cd1533fb11b2, under the W3C Software Notice
and License. The ATAG 2.0 specification is a W3C Recommendation. See the vendored
LICENSE and README.
